; F-099 AutoCAD 2024.1.2 reference workflow.
; Owned scratch drawing only: switch to an ISO A3 paper layout, remove its
; template viewport, create two independent MVIEW objects, redefine the second
; with VPCLIP using a closed paper-space polyline, save/reopen the native DWG,
; activate the clipped viewport's MODEL context, return to PAPER, delete it,
; and verify the first viewport remains unchanged.
_.REGENALL
